            <ArticleTitle>Facial pains and anxiety levels: considerations for treatment.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>434-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The data presented in this article question the traditional beliefs in the dental literature about the relationship between facial pain and anxiety. The findings have important implications for treating individuals with any of the IFP syndromes.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
